OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,FImprovements have been made to
OL,7,Fspecialist community mental health
OL,8,Fservices for children and young people
OL,9,Fin the region, the Care Quality
OL,10,FCommission (CQC) has said.
OL,12,FThe services run by Tees, Esk and Wear
OL,13,FValleys NHS Foundation Trust (TEWV)
OL,14,Fare now rated as 'good', having
OL,15,Fpreviously been rated as 'requires
OL,16,Fimprovement'.
OL,18,FThe overall rating for the trust
OL,19,Fremains as requires improvement.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/11
