FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,FThe services inspected provide
OL,7,Fspecialist community mental health
OL,8,Fsupport for children and young people
OL,9,Fup to the age of 18.
OL,11,FThe CQC carried out the inspection in
OL,12,FApril and found improvements had been
OL,13,Fmade, but there was still work to do
OL,14,Fin some areas. They said it was
OL,15,F"effective, well-led, caring and
OL,16,Fresponsive" but that some young
OL,17,Fpeople's risk assessments did not have
OL,18,Fcontingency plans to keep them safe.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,FBeverley Murphy, chief nurse for TEWV
OL,7,Fsaid the report demonstrated positive
OL,8,Fchanges that had been made and added
OL,9,Fthat they recognised the areas that
OL,10,Fneed to improve.
OL,12,FJayne Reid, CQC deputy director of
OL,13,Fmental health in the North East, said:
OL,14,F"At this inspection, we were
OL,15,Fencouraged to see improvements across
OL,16,Fthe service, and we saw staff
OL,17,Fregularly going above and beyond to
OL,18,Fensure children and young people were
OL,19,Freceiving a good level of care.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"Inspectors sat in several
OL,7,Fappointments between staff and young
OL,8,Fpeople and observed kind and
OL,9,Fcompassionate approaches from staff. A
OL,10,Ftheme throughout the inspection was
OL,11,Fyoung people telling us they felt seen
OL,12,Fand heard by staff and felt safe to
OL,13,Fopen up to them.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"It was positive to hear relatives and
OL,7,Fcarers say that they were met with
OL,8,Fwarmth, understanding and patience by
OL,9,Fstaff and that their loved ones looked
OL,10,Fforward to their appointments. One
OL,11,Fcarer fed back that they have regular
OL,12,Fcontact with the crisis team for their
OL,13,Fchild and each time, they consistently
OL,14,Fwent the extra mile to ensure their
OL,15,Fchild is listened to and supported.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"Leaders ensured there was continuity
OL,7,Fof care when young people moved
OL,8,Fbetween different services or into
OL,9,Fadult mental health services. Although
OL,10,Fwaiting lists remained high, these
OL,11,Fwere less than the national comparison
OL,12,Fand staff used tools to identify and
OL,13,Ftake action if a young person's risk
OL,14,Fwas escalating.
OL,16,F"Staff praised improvements regarding
OL,17,Fyoung people being seen more quickly,
OL,18,Fstating that referrals were now
OL,19,Freaching teams best suited to their
OL,20,Fneeds, ensuring those with more
OL,21,Fcomplex needs could be seen quicker.
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"However, improvements are still
OL,7,Fneeded regarding young people's risk
OL,8,Fassessments. Inspectors looked at some
OL,9,Fthat didn't include plans to manage
OL,10,Frisks or what the contingency plans
OL,11,Fwere to keep them safe.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"Leaders and staff should feel proud
OL,7,Fof the changes they've made and the
OL,8,Fpositive impact these changes have had
OL,9,Fon young people using services. We've
OL,10,Fshared our findings with leaders, so
OL,11,Fthey know what improvements need to be
OL,12,Fmade to keep people safe and we'll
OL,13,Fcontinue to monitor the trust to
OL,14,Fensure the quality of care is embedded
OL,15,Fand sustained."
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/11
