PN,39709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,FMs Murphy said: "This report shows the
OL,7,Fdetermination of our colleagues to
OL,8,Fimprove care for young people across
OL,9,Four communities. We're incredibly
OL,10,Fproud of our CAMHS service and, most
OL,11,Fimportantly, the dedicated staff who
OL,12,Fmake a positive difference every day.
OL,26,@nD@QOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"We're pleased that the service has
OL,7,Fbeen rated good overall, with
OL,8,Finspectors recognising caring,
OL,9,Fcompassionate and committed staff,
OL,10,Fpositive feedback from young people
OL,11,Fand carers, and improvements in
OL,12,Fstaffing, responsiveness and how teams
OL,13,Fwork together. It also demonstrates
OL,14,Fthe positive changes we've made since
OL,15,Four last inspection in 2022, when this
OL,16,Fservice was rated as requires
OL,17,Fimprovement.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786551523
OL,3,CMental health service for children has
OL,4,Crating upgraded
OL,6,F"Alongside our partners we've improved
OL,7,Faccess to care so young people can get
OL,8,Fhelp more quickly, closer to home and
OL,9,Fin ways that support them to thrive in
OL,10,Ftheir families and communities.
OL,12,F"We recognise the areas we need to
OL,13,Fimprove. The report is clear that we
OL,14,Fmust strengthen the consistency of
OL,15,Frisk assessments, safety summaries and
OL,16,Fsafety plans. We will take action on
OL,17,Fthis and continue to focus on
OL,18,Flearning, improvement and providing
OL,19,Fsafe, kind and person-centred care."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G11/11
